{"book":23,"chapter":4,"context":{"chapter":4,"title":"The Branch and the Glory","summary":"After judgment so few men remain that seven women seek one husband. Then 'the branch of the Lord' flourishes, the survivors are called holy, and God's glory shelters Zion like the cloud and fire of the exodus.","background":"War could leave so many men dead that families feared their names would die out, and a woman without husband or children bore a social 'reproach' (v. 1). 'Branch' (v. 2) later became a title for the coming Messiah (Jeremiah 23:5; Zechariah 3:8), though here it may also describe the land's renewed fruitfulness.","customs":[{"term":"Cloud by day, fire by night","verses":"4:5","note":"Recalls the pillar of cloud and fire that led Israel out of Egypt and showed God's presence (Exodus 13:21-22)."}],"watchFor":["Those 'written among the living' (v. 3), like names in a city register.","Cleansing comes 'by the spirit of judgment, and by the spirit of burning' (v. 4).","The chapter ends in shelter: shade, refuge, covering (v. 6)."],"connections":["Exodus 13:21-22","Jeremiah 23:5","Zechariah 3:8","Psalms 121:5-6"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["וְהֶחֱזִיקוּ","vehecheziku","H2388","Hc/Vhq3cp","and they will take hold"],["שֶׁבַע","sheva'","H7651","HAcbsa","seven"],["נָשִׁים","nashim","H802","HNcmpa","women"],["בְּאִישׁ","be'ish","H376","HR/Ncmsa","on a man"],["אֶחָד","'echad","H259","HAcfsa","one"],["בַּיּוֹם","baiyom","H3117","HRd/Ncmsa","in the day"],["הַהוּא","hahu'","H1931","HTd/Pp3ms","<the> that"],["לֵאמֹר","lemor","H559","HR/Vqcc","<to> saying"],["לַחְמֵנוּ","lachmenu","H3899","HNcbsc/Sp1mp","own food our"],["נֹאכֵל","nokhel","H398","HVqi1cp","we will eat"],["וְשִׂמְלָתֵנוּ","vesimlatenu","H8071","HC/Ncfsc/Sp1bp","and own clothing our"],["נִלְבָּשׁ","nilbash","H3847","HVqi1cp","we will wear"],["רַק","rak","H7535","HD","only"],["יִקָּרֵא","yikare'","H7121","HVNi3ms","let it be called"],["שִׁמְךָ","shimkha","H8034","HNcmsc/Sp2ms","name your"],["עָלֵינוּ","'aleinu","H592